invalid type: string "Mega HR WebsiteEnglish\nSearch for articles...\nAll CollectionsGetting StartedCustomize Careers Page\nCustomize Careers Page\nUpdated over 3 months ago\nIt's important to show candidates what your company is all about, not just list a job \ndescription. Sharing company details on your careers page helps attract candidates who \nwant to learn more and apply with enthusiasm.\nt